# 统一换行符：脚本与源码在库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出后 gradlew 带 CRLF 无法执行
* text=auto
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
